<title>DENMARK: FLS wins Bolivian cement plant order.</title>
<headline>FLS wins Bolivian cement plant order.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cement and engineering group FLS Industries said on Wednesday its F.L. Smidth &amp; Co unit signed a $20 million contract to enlarge a cement factory for Bolivia's Sociedad Boliviana de Cemento S.A. (SOBOCE).</p>
<p>It said the deal provided equipment for a 1,000 tonnes per day cement production line at an existing SOBOCE plant near La Paz, Bolivia's capital.</p>
<p>The new production line is due to go on line in 1999, FLS said.</p>
<p>--Soeren Linding Jakobsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
